ow they experience",395.99770000000001,259.75500000000034,539.96019999999999,268.77750000000037,7.5,false],["the “fallen condition” this passage reveals (i.e,",395.99770000000001,267.75750000000039,539.95270000000005,276.78000000000043,7.5,false],["some aspect of their brokenness that requires the",395.99770000000001,275.76000000000045,539.96019999999999,284.78250000000043,7.5,false],["redemptive work of Christ).",395.99770000000001,283.76250000000044,469.31020000000001,292.78500000000042,7.5,false],["Ask a couple questions that point them to Christ.",395.99770000000001,296.64000000000044,539.93770000000006,305.78250000000043,7.5,false],["What aspect of God’s redemptive work do they need",395.99770000000001,304.76250000000044,539.95270000000005,313.78500000000042,7.5,false],["to believe and embrace in order to reflect and enjoy",395.99770000000001,312.76500000000044,539.94520000000011,321.78750000000042,7.5,false],["God’s glory?",395.99770000000001,320.76750000000044,428.64519999999999,329.79000000000042,7.5,false],["Small Group Lesson Template",63.084900000000005,415.45343050000002,393.55228950000014,450.76237500000002,28.965500000000002,false],["Determine the learning objectives in response to the following questions:",72.795000000000002,472.12,83.76600000000002,739.60000000000002,9,false],["ELEmenTS",153.5,516.79500000000007,194,527.76600000000008,9,false],["Ask a question that",153.5,531.28250000000003,212.00749999999999,540.30500000000006,7.5,false],["will cultivate inter-",153.5,539.28499999999997,212,548.3075,7.5,false],["est in your study by",153.5,547.28750000000002,211.99250000000001,556.30999999999995,7.5,false],["raising a problem or",153.5,555.28999999999996,212,564.3125,7.5,false],["issue that your pas-",153.5,563.29250000000002,212,572.31500000000005,7.5,false],["sage addresses. (At",153.5,571.29499999999996,212.00000000000003,580.3175,7.5,false],["this stage, your link",153.5,579.29750000000001,211.99250000000001,588.31999999999994,7.5,false],["to th